    "doc_text": "WSJ891030-0149 \n = 891030 \n 891030-0149. \n Trustcorp Inc. to Change Name \n 10/30/89 \n WALL STREET JOURNAL (J) \n TTCO SOCI \n TENDER OFFERS, MERGERS, ACQUISITIONS (TNM)\nBANKS (BNK) \n TOLEDO, Ohio  \n\n   Trustcorp Inc. will become Society Bank amp Trust when its merger is completed with Society Corp. of Cleveland, the bank said. \n\n   Society Corp., which is also a bank, agreed in June to buy Trustcorp for 12.4 million shares of stock with a market value of about $450 million. \nThe transaction is expected to close around year end.",
